  "yourDataTitle": "Latermark & Your Data",
  "yourDataSubtitle": "We care about your privacy, and treat it with respect.",
  "yourDataSafetyQuestion": "Is my data safe?",
  "yourDataSafetyAnswer": "Latermark processes your notes, photos, and location tags entirely on your device. Unless you choose to share them, your content never leaves it—not for analytics, crash reports, usage statistics, or advertising. The app contains no third-party tracking or advertising SDK. The only network traffic is the App Store handling your purchase.",
  "yourDataLocationQuestion": "Why does Latermark ask for location access?",
  "yourDataLocationAnswer": "Latermark asks for a one-time location only when you choose to tag where a photo was taken. The coordinates are saved only with that entry; there is no background tracking. They are passed to another app only if you choose to open the map.",
  "yourDataPhotosQuestion": "How is photo access used?",
  "yourDataPhotosAnswer": "It is used only when you choose an image from your photo library instead of taking a new one. Latermark imports only the image you select, and the process does not require an internet connection.",
  "yourDataRemindersQuestion": "How do reminders work?",
  "yourDataRemindersAnswer": "Reminders are scheduled on your device and shown by your device. No external server sends or triggers them.",
  "yourDataDeletionQuestion": "What happens if I delete the app?",
  "yourDataDeletionAnswer": "Notes, imported images, and location tags stored in Latermark are permanently deleted. Your photo library and data in other apps are not affected.",
